"Show or hide the nights, breaks, weekends and holidays of the work centers; "
"your choice is remembered"
msgstr ""
"Показва или скрива нощите, почивките, уикендите и празниците на центровете; "
"изборът ви се запомня"

#. module: mrp_workcenter_crew_roster
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_workcenter_crew_roster.field_mrp_workcenter_roster__date_to
