msgstr "Позволени служители"

#. module: mrp_workcenter_crew_roster
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_workcenter_crew_roster.field_hr_employee__crew_roster_count
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_workcenter_crew_roster.field_mrp_workcenter__crew_roster_count
